# game/script.rpy:18
translate indonesian start_915cb944:

    # "It's only when I hear the sounds of shuffling feet and supplies being put away that I realize that the lecture's over."
    "Barulah ketika aku mendengar suara langkah kaki yang menyeret dan perlengkapan yang sedang disimpan, aku menyadari bahwa kuliah telah berakhir."

# game/script.rpy:20
translate indonesian start_d48fb984:

    # "Professor Eileen's lectures are usually interesting, but today I just couldn't concentrate on it."
    "Kelas Professor Eileen biasanya menarik, tetapi hari ini aku sama sekali tidak bisa berkonsentrasi padanya."

# game/script.rpy:22
translate indonesian start_622654e3:

    # "I've had a lot of other thoughts on my mind...thoughts that culminate in a question."
    "Aku punya banyak pikiran lain... pikiran-pikiran yang bermuara pada sebuah pertanyaan."

# game/script.rpy:24
translate indonesian start_5aee3489:

    # "It's a question that I've been meaning to ask a certain someone."
    "Ini adalah pertanyaan yang sudah lama ingin aku tanyakan kepada seseorang."

# game/script.rpy:29
translate indonesian start_66c6d238:

    # "When we come out of the university, I spot her right away."
    "Saat kami keluar dari universitas, aku langsung melihatnya."

# game/script.rpy:34
translate indonesian start_1d44d9d7:

    # "I've known Sylvie since we were kids. She's got a big heart and she's always been a good friend to me."
    "Aku sudah mengenal Sylvie sejak kami masih kecil. Dia berhati besar dan selalu menjadi teman yang baik bagiku."

# game/script.rpy:36
translate indonesian start_1c8af99f:

    # "But recently... I've felt that I want something more."
    "Namun belakangan ini... aku merasa menginginkan sesuatu yang lebih."

# game/script.rpy:38
translate indonesian start_17a1771f:

    # "More than just talking, more than just walking home together when our classes end."
    "Lebih dari sekadar mengobrol, lebih dari sekadar berjalan pulang bersama saat kelas kita usai."

# game/script.rpy:57
translate indonesian rightaway_cf214f74:

    # s "Hi there! How was class?"
    s "Hai! Bagaimana kelas tadi?"

# game/script.rpy:59
translate indonesian rightaway_f5f51c33:

    # m "Good..."
    m "Good..."

# game/script.rpy:61
translate indonesian rightaway_027fd9f0:

    # "I can't bring myself to admit that it all went in one ear and out the other."
    "Aku tak sanggup mengakui bahwa semua itu hanya masuk telinga kanan dan keluar telinga kiri."

# game/script.rpy:63
translate indonesian rightaway_1e626e6b:

    # m "Are you going home now? Wanna walk back with me?"
    m "Kamu mau pulang sekarang? Mau pulang bareng aku?"

# game/script.rpy:65
translate indonesian rightaway_ed1dfb9d:

    # s "Sure!"
    s "Tentu!"

# game/script.rpy:70
translate indonesian rightaway_03faae39:

    # "After a short while, we reach the meadows just outside the neighborhood where we both live."
    "Setelah beberapa saat, kami sampai di padang rumput tepat di luar lingkungan tempat kami berdua tinggal."

# game/script.rpy:72
translate indonesian rightaway_b3b54d3c:

    # "It's a scenic view I've grown used to. Autumn is especially beautiful here."
    "Pemandangannya indah dan aku sudah biasa melihatnya. Musim gugur sangat indah di sini."

# game/script.rpy:74
translate indonesian rightaway_8f173bb5:

    # "When we were children, we played in these meadows a lot, so they're full of memories."
    "Saat kami masih kecil, kami sering bermain di padang rumput ini, jadi tempat ini penuh dengan kenangan."

# game/script.rpy:76
translate indonesian rightaway_aa84c954:

    # m "Hey... Umm..."
    m "Hey... Umm..."

# game/script.rpy:81
translate indonesian rightaway_79becbf8:

    # "She turns to me and smiles. She looks so welcoming that I feel my nervousness melt away."
    "Dia menoleh ke arahku dan tersenyum. Dia tampak begitu ramah sehingga rasa gugupku pun sirna."

# game/script.rpy:83
translate indonesian rightaway_6a5d032c:

    # "I'll ask her...!"
    "Aku akan bertanya padanya...!"

# game/script.rpy:85
translate indonesian rightaway_29e68260:

    # m "Ummm... Will you..."
    m "Ummm... Maukah kamu..."

# game/script.rpy:87
translate indonesian rightaway_6c267868:

    # m "Will you be my artist for a visual novel?"
    m "Maukah kamu bersedia menjadi ilustrator untuk visual novel ku?"

# game/script.rpy:91
translate indonesian rightaway_16b8cb94:

    # "Silence."
    ".......krik-krik....krik-krik..........."

# game/script.rpy:93
translate indonesian rightaway_289664f3:

    # "She looks so shocked that I begin to fear the worst. But then..."
    "Dia tampak sangat terkejut sehingga aku mulai khawatir akan hal terburuk. Tapi kemudian..."

# game/script.rpy:99
translate indonesian rightaway_8cb5deeb:

    # s "Sure, but what's a \"visual novel?\"" nointeract
    s "Ya, tapi apa itu \"visual novel?\"" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:110
translate indonesian game_65cca574:

    # m "It's a kind of videogame you can play on your computer or a console."
    m "Ini adalah jenis permainan video yang bisa kamu mainkan di komputer atau konsol."

# game/script.rpy:112
translate indonesian game_da120cd2:

    # m "Visual novels tell a story with pictures and music."
    m "Novel visual menceritakan sebuah kisah melalui gambar dan musik."

# game/script.rpy:114
translate indonesian game_0157c4d2:

    # m "Sometimes, you also get to make choices that affect the outcome of the story."
    m "Terkadang, kamu juga harus membuat pilihan yang memengaruhi hasil akhir cerita."

# game/script.rpy:116
translate indonesian game_68b33461:

    # s "So it's like those choose-your-adventure books?"
    s "Jadi, ini seperti buku petualangan pilihanmu sendiri?"

# game/script.rpy:118
translate indonesian game_fa834128:

    # m "Exactly! I've got lots of different ideas that I think would work."
    m "Tepat sekali! Aku punya banyak ide berbeda yang menurutku bisa berhasil."

# game/script.rpy:120
translate indonesian game_d9b28ade:

    # m "And I thought maybe you could help me...since I know how you like to draw."
    m "Dan kupikir mungkin kau bisa membantuku... karena aku tahu kau suka menggambar."

# game/script.rpy:122
translate indonesian game_eaa56bc9:

    # m "It'd be hard for me to make a visual novel alone."
    m "Akan sulit bagi ku untuk membuat visual novel sendirian."

# game/script.rpy:126
translate indonesian game_9befd1bf:

    # s "Well, sure! I can try. I just hope I don't disappoint you."
    s "Baiklah, tentu! Aku bisa mencoba. Aku hanya berharap aku tidak mengecewakanmu."

# game/script.rpy:128
translate indonesian game_c788ae90:

    # m "You know you could never disappoint me, Sylvie."
    m "Kau tahu kau tak akan pernah mengecewakanku, Sylvie."

# game/script.rpy:137
translate indonesian book_4221b3bd:

    # m "It's like an interactive book that you can read on a computer or a console."
    m "Ini seperti buku interaktif yang bisa Kamu baca di komputer atau konsol."

# game/script.rpy:141
translate indonesian book_4cfd8044:

    # s "Interactive?"
    s "interaktif?"

# game/script.rpy:143
translate indonesian book_b9c732c8:

    # m "You can make choices that lead to different events and endings in the story."
    m "Kau dapat membuat pilihan yang mengarah ke berbagai peristiwa dan akhir cerita yang berbeda."

# game/script.rpy:145
translate indonesian book_1c7ac61a:

    # s "So where does the \"visual\" part come in?"
    s "Jadi, di mana letak bagian \"visual\"-nya?"

# game/script.rpy:147
translate indonesian book_763f25a8:

    # m "Visual novels have pictures and even music, sound effects, and sometimes voice acting to go along with the text."
    m "Visual novel memiliki gambar dan bahkan musik, efek suara, dan terkadang pengisi suara untuk melengkapi teks."

# game/script.rpy:151
translate indonesian book_2277f2aa:

    # s "I see! That certainly sounds like fun. I actually used to make webcomics way back when, so I've got lots of story ideas."
    s "Oh, begitu! Itu pasti terdengar menyenangkan. Dulu aku juga pernah membuat komik web, jadi aku punya banyak ide cerita."

# game/script.rpy:153
translate indonesian book_ccd3e9b0:

    # m "That's great! So...would you be interested in working with me as an artist?"
    m "Bagus sekali! Jadi...apakah Kamu tertarik untuk bekerja sama dengan ku sebagai seorang seniman?"

# game/script.rpy:155
translate indonesian book_e325967b:

    # s "I'd love to!"
    s "Aku sangat ingin!"

# game/script.rpy:164
translate indonesian marry_4509e340:

    # "And so, we become a visual novel creating duo."
    "Dan begitulah, kami menjadi duo pencipta novel visual."

# game/script.rpy:169
translate indonesian marry_0f82ff7f:

    # "Over the years, we make lots of games and have a lot of fun making them."
    "Selama bertahun-tahun, kami membuat banyak game dan sangat menikmati proses pembuatannya."

# game/script.rpy:173
translate indonesian marry_08e24a18:

    # "Our first game is based on one of Sylvie's ideas, but afterwards I get to come up with stories of my own, too."
    "Game pertama kami didasarkan pada salah satu ide Sylvie, tetapi setelah itu aku juga bisa membuat cerita sendiri."

# game/script.rpy:175
translate indonesian marry_285256a1:

    # "We take turns coming up with stories and characters and support each other to make some great games!"
    "Kami bergiliran menciptakan cerita dan karakter, serta saling mendukung untuk membuat game-game hebat!"

# game/script.rpy:177
translate indonesian marry_27260f18:

    # "And one day..."
    "Dan suatu hari..."

# game/script.rpy:182
translate indonesian marry_bf690666:

    # s "Hey..."
    s "Hei..."

# game/script.rpy:184
translate indonesian marry_7a5c1899:

    # m "Yes?"
    m "Ya?"

# game/script.rpy:188
translate indonesian marry_3c154e68:

    # s "Will you marry me?"
    s "Maukah kamu menikah denganku?"

# game/script.rpy:190
translate indonesian marry_8bcbc4b9:

    # m "What? Where did this come from?"
    m "Apa? Dari mana ini berasal?"

# game/script.rpy:194
translate indonesian marry_f913278c:

    # s "Come on, how long have we been dating?"
    s "Ayolah, sudah berapa lama kita berpacaran?"

# game/script.rpy:196
translate indonesian marry_4ba892a0:

    # m "A while..."
    m "Beberapa saat..."

# game/script.rpy:200
translate indonesian marry_39d7f0df:

    # s "These last few years we've been making visual novels together, spending time together, helping each other..."
    s "Beberapa tahun terakhir ini kami telah membuat novel visual bersama, menghabiskan waktu bersama, saling membantu..."

# game/script.rpy:202
translate indonesian marry_1516df50:

    # s "I've gotten to know you and care about you better than anyone else. And I think the same goes for you, right?"
    s "Aku sudah mengenalmu dan peduli padamu lebih baik dari siapa pun. Dan kurasa hal yang sama juga berlaku untukmu, kan?"

# game/script.rpy:204
translate indonesian marry_3234b0ab:

    # m "Sylvie..."
    m "Sylvie..."

# game/script.rpy:208
translate indonesian marry_8179b35b:

    # s "But I know you're the indecisive type. If I held back, who knows when you'd propose?"
    s "Tapi aku tahu kau tipe orang yang ragu-ragu. Jika aku menahan diri, siapa tahu kapan kau akan melamar?"

# game/script.rpy:212
translate indonesian marry_373937d9:

    # s "So will you marry me?"
    s "Jadi, maukah kau menikah denganku?"

# game/script.rpy:214
translate indonesian marry_857958dc:

    # m "Of course I will! I've actually been meaning to propose, honest!"
    m "Tentu saja aku mau! Aku memang sudah berniat melamar, sungguh!"

# game/script.rpy:216
translate indonesian marry_81ed468b:

    # s "I know, I know."
    s "Aku tahu, aku tahu."

# game/script.rpy:218
translate indonesian marry_1c4ae954:

    # m "I guess... I was too worried about timing. I wanted to ask the right question at the right time."
    m "Kurasa... aku terlalu khawatir soal waktu. Aku ingin mengajukan pertanyaan yang tepat pada waktu yang tepat."

# game/script.rpy:222
translate indonesian marry_0db38565:

    # s "You worry too much. If only this were a visual novel and I could pick an option to give you more courage!"
    s "Kamu terlalu banyak khawatir. Seandainya ini adalah novel visual dan aku bisa memilih opsi untuk memberimu lebih banyak keberanian!"

# game/script.rpy:227
translate indonesian marry_ca27786f:

    # "We get married shortly after that."
    "Kami menikah tak lama setelah itu."

# game/script.rpy:229
translate indonesian marry_621ed4fc:

    # "Our visual novel duo lives on even after we're married...and I try my best to be more decisive."
    "Duo novel visual kami tetap berlanjut bahkan setelah kami menikah... dan aku berusaha sebaik mungkin untuk lebih tegas dalam mengambil keputusan."

# game/script.rpy:231
translate indonesian marry_3c7f0bf0:

    # "Together, we live happily ever after even now."
    "Bersama, kita hidup bahagia selamanya bahkan hingga sekarang."

# game/script.rpy:233
translate indonesian marry_2ad49007:

    # "{b}Good Ending{/b}."
    "{b}Good Ending{/b}."

# game/script.rpy:239
translate indonesian later_3c679c17:

    # "I can't get up the nerve to ask right now. With a gulp, I decide to ask her later."
    "Aku tak sanggup mengumpulkan keberanian untuk bertanya sekarang. Dengan berat hati, aku memutuskan untuk bertanya padanya nanti."

# game/script.rpy:244
translate indonesian later_a77741b6:

    # "But I'm an indecisive person."
    "Tapi aku orang yang ragu-ragu."

# game/script.rpy:246
translate indonesian later_982e14b6:

    # "I couldn't ask her that day and I end up never being able to ask her."
    "Aku tidak bisa bertanya padanya hari itu dan akhirnya aku tidak pernah bisa bertanya padanya."

# game/script.rpy:248
translate indonesian later_f0f9a061:

    # "I guess I'll never know the answer to my question now..."
    "Sepertinya aku tak akan pernah tahu jawaban atas pertanyaanku sekarang..."

# game/script.rpy:250
translate indonesian later_f5219ac2:

    # "{b}Bad Ending{/b}."
    "{b}Bad Ending{/b}."

